---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<SiteLayout title="Contact RewardPath Guide" description="Contact RewardPath Guide with editorial feedback, corrections, or general questions.">
  <section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><span class="section-kicker">GET IN TOUCH</span><h1>We value your<br /><em>feedback.</em></h1><p>Questions, corrections, or suggestions for a future guide are welcome.</p><div class="breadcrumb"><a href={base}>Home</a><span>/</span><span>Contact</span></div></div></section>
  <section class="prose-page section-space"><div class="container contact-container"><div class="contact-card"><span class="contact-card-icon">✉</span><span class="section-kicker">EDITORIAL & GENERAL ENQUIRIES</span><h2>Send us a note.</h2><p>For now, contact the site owner by email. Replace the placeholder address below with your real email before publishing.</p><a class="button button-primary" href="mailto:REPLACE-WITH-YOUR-EMAIL@example.com">Email RewardPath <span>↗</span></a><p class="small-note">Site owner: replace <strong>masumislam57888@gmail.com</strong> in this page with an address you control.</p></div><div class="contact-side"><h3>What can you contact us about?</h3><ul><li>Article corrections or factual feedback</li><li>Suggestions for new educational topics</li><li>Privacy-related questions</li><li>Website accessibility or technical issues</li></ul><p>We cannot verify, approve, or award prizes for promotions run by other companies. For a specific promotion, contact the sponsor named in its official rules.</p></div></div></section>
</SiteLayout>
